# PurohitConnect Flutter

Match website flows before new UX. Selected chips use `AppTheme.sacredGold` (`#F59E0B`), not midnight or orange `primary`.

```dart
// BAD
selectedColor: AppTheme.templeMidnight;
child: Text('PC'); // hardcoded mark for every purohit

// GOOD
AppSelectChip(label: city, selected: selected, onTap: ...);
DevoteeAvatar(name: p.name, imageUrl: p.avatarUrl); // photo or initial
```

- Back chevron: `AppBackButton` (rust). Hide on tab roots via `AppBackButton.maybe(context)`.
- Support bot (`SupportBotOverlay`) hides while a modal/sheet is open; filter sheets must scroll (`isScrollControlled` + `Expanded`).
- No runtime `google_fonts` on web. Use bundled `AppSans`.
- API via `ApiConstants` (8001 first). Resolve media with `ApiConstants.resolveMediaUrl`.
- After UI changes, restart Chrome on port 5173 so OneDrive builds pick up new files.
